# Benchmark output. A committed result is a latency claim nobody can
# reproduce, and it goes stale the moment the model or the tree moves.
bench/results/

# Exported session transcripts and logs. `recordings/` and `history/` above
# keep the app's own storage out, but the history window's Save… button writes
# wherever the file dialog last was — and QFileDialog opens on the process CWD,
# which is the repo root when the app is launched with `python main.py`. That
# put a real khutbah transcript one `git add .` away from a public commit
# (observed 2026-08-07). These names come from history_window.py's suggestions.
/MinbarLive_????-??-??.txt
/MinbarLive_????-??-??.srt
/MinbarLive_????-??-??.log
/MinbarLive_cost.txt
